- **Armybuilding** — Standalone army management with an Army List Panel (search/filter/validation status) and Army Editor Panel (live value tracking, inline Roster validation). Clarifies that in-campaign snapshots are not affected by external edits.

- **Campaign Editor** — Three-panel editor (Campaign Browser, Sector Map Canvas, Properties Panel) for creating custom Campaigns with drag-and-drop Plot placement, travel requirements, and graph completability validation before publication.

- **Unit Editor** — Three-panel editor (Unit Browser, Datasheet Editor, Validation Panel) mirroring the Datasheet structure. Custom Units scoped to Freeplay and custom Campaigns only. Includes balance estimation and structural validation.

- **Settings** — Tabbed categories (Gameplay, Controls, Video, Audio, Accessibility) with per-tab and global "Restore Defaults". References the F10 Menu Hotkey and accessibility features like colorblind modes and screen reader support.

- **Exit Game** — Closes the application with an unsaved-state confirmation dialog offering Save and Exit, Exit without Saving, or Cancel.

All changes are uncommitted and ready for manual review.

